    <string name="info_model_score" formatted="false">Our own model calculates this score. It weighs the horse\'s AGF, expert views, recent races, handicap rating, AGF movement, carried weight and track fit together and gives each horse a single 0–100 score. A higher score means a stronger contender, but not a sure winner.</string>
